Third-party material
--------------------
apps/web/src/lib/overleaf/features/source-editor/languages/latex/completions/data/*
  LaTeX completion data (command snippets with usage scores, environment
  templates, package / class / bibliography style names) copied from Overleaf
  (https://github.com/overleaf/overleaf, commit e039ad26c5bf5422eb57b89fc7e57c75055e631d).
  Copyright (C) Overleaf. Licensed under the GNU AGPL v3.

apps/web/src/lib/latexCompletion.ts
  The completion behaviour (environment snippets offered as "\begin{env} …"
  command completions, "$1" placeholder conversion, extending over an unpaired
  closing brace) follows Overleaf's source-editor implementation.

apps/web/src/lib/overleaf/features/**
  Overleaf's CodeMirror 6 LaTeX language support, copied from
  services/web/frontend/js/features/** at the same commit, keeping Overleaf's
  directory layout so the original "@/..." imports resolve unchanged:
    - lezer-latex/latex.grammar, lezer-latex/tokens.mjs (Lezer LaTeX grammar;
      the parser is generated at build time by apps/web/scripts/build-lezer.mjs)
    - languages/latex/latex-language.ts (highlighting, folding, node groups)
    - languages/latex/linter/* (real-time LaTeX linter running in a Web Worker)
    - utils/tree-operations/*, utils/tree-query.ts, utils/range.ts, utils/node-props.ts
  Copyright (C) Overleaf. Licensed under the GNU AGPL v3.
  Local modifications (marked "TeXdraft 修改" in the file headers):
    - languages/latex/close-bracket-config.ts: reduced to the standard
      @codemirror/autocomplete config (Overleaf relies on a forked package).
    - languages/latex/linter/latex-linter.ts: removed a webpack magic comment so
      Vite can bundle the worker.
    - commands/ranges.ts, extensions/toolbar/{commands,lists,sections,snippets}.ts,
      utils/tree-operations/formatting.ts, languages/latex/snippets.ts (formatting toolbar)
    - word-count-modal/{utils,components/word-count-data.ts}, utils/walk-included-files.ts
      (client-side word count with Intl.Segmenter, used for Chinese)
    - languages/latex/completions/data/* (completion data, see above)
  Stubs written for TeXdraft (not Overleaf code): extensions/annotations.ts,
  extensions/figure-modal.ts, extensions/visual/visual.ts, ide-react/context/outline-context.ts,
  infrastructure/{event-tracking,project-snapshot}.ts, features/event-tracking/search-events.ts,
  utils/debugging.ts, shims/o-error.ts.

apps/web/src/lib/mathPreview.ts
  Math preview tooltip modelled on Overleaf's extensions/math-preview.ts, rendered
  with KaTeX instead of MathJax.

Design references (no code copied)
----------------------------------
